## Kenyans react to Nairobi's name
The character's alias creates an immediate personal connection for Kenyan viewers, since Nairobi is the name of their capital city.
That bond was clear in the comments section, where fans mixed grief with humour in classic Kenyan fashion.
@Mdzukulu Wa Stephen Makoti:
> "I blame rais for this😭❤️"
@Abubakar Habibu:
> "Berlin died. Nairobi died. Tokyo died. Which kind movie is this 😱"
@OL IV ER:
> "If Nairobi died then we have Mombasa😅"
@Bill Henry:
> "I blame the man for this 😩😩😩"
@Francis Kimani:
> "Even in movies they can't defend his people, wantam 😱"
@David Jokanola:
> "The only time we love thieves 😅😅😅"
@Ombati KE:
> "If it were not for him, Nairobi would be alive now 😰 he'll go, he must go I'm sure he will 😀"
The mix of political jokes and genuine sadness captured exactly why Nairobi remains one of the most talked-about characters in the series, long after her final scene aired.
